#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/main-character.md:1
msgid "主要人物"
msgstr "Main Characters"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/main-character.md:3
msgid "我（玩家）"
msgstr "I (Player)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/main-character.md:5
msgid "我（Q版）"
msgstr "I (Chibi)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/main-character.md:9
#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/main-character.md:21
#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/main-character.md:36
#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/main-character.md:50
#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/main-character.md:65
msgid "人物介绍"
msgstr "Character Introduction"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/main-character.md:10
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;我是一名玩家，正在游玩一款名为"灵数奇缘"的游戏。这个游戏讲述了两个世界之间各色角色之间的斗争。两个世界分别是主世界（后世界）以及被创造的游戏世界。"
"   "
"​&emsp;&emsp;我在里面是一个被羽凌灵（女主）委派任务进入游戏世界的代理人。临危受命一切都很突然，但不得不惊叹一番游戏世界对主世界的还原程度之高。在游戏世界里我遇到了很多的角色，经历了很多战斗，玩游戏拯救世界什么的说的就是我吧。"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;我的在后世界中的设定似乎是一名侦探，特长是解决眼前的难题，管他是用脑子也好拳脚也罢，我总能解决，但是这次的"案件"让我很是头大，第一次遇见了超过自己能力范围这么多的难题。但是我是主角吧，什么问题可以难道我？就算有网上能查攻略吧？宫崎英高都没能阻止我？这个游戏凭什么？"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;一开始我对游戏世界内发生的一切不感兴趣，因为一切都是数据，认为只是在和NPC对话；但在和妮妮莉特经历了游戏世界的种种冒险后，逐渐开始与这些游戏角色产生共情，并当作朋友，不惜一切代价守护这些"数据"。我逐渐理解那些对着纸片人喊老婆的人的心态了。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;I am a player, currently playing a game called \"Luv Sense Digital.\" "
"This game tells the story of struggles between various characters across two "
"worlds. The two worlds are the Main World (Post-World) and the created Game World."
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;In the game, I am an agent dispatched by Yu Lingling (the heroine) "
"into the game world to carry out missions. Everything happened suddenly, but I "
"have to marvel at how faithfully the game world reproduces the Main World. In the "
"game world, I met many characters, experienced many battles — \"playing a game to "
"save the world\" pretty much describes me."
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;My setting in the post-world seems to be that of a detective. My "
"specialty is solving problems right in front of me — whether using brains or "
"brawn, I always manage. But this \"case\" has me stumped. It's the first time "
"I've encountered a problem so far beyond my abilities. But I'm the protagonist, "
"right? What problem could stump me? Even if there are online walkthroughs, right? "
"If even Miyazaki Hidetaka couldn't stop me, what gives this game the right?"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;At first, I wasn't interested in what happened in the game world. "
"Everything was just data, and I thought I was merely talking to NPCs. But after "
"experiencing all sorts of adventures in the game world with Ninillet, I gradually "
"began to empathize with these game characters, treating them as friends and "
"protecting this \"data\" at all costs. I'm starting to understand the mindset of "
"those who call 2D characters their wives."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/main-character.md:17
msgid "妮妮莉特"
msgstr "Ninillet"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/main-character.md:19
msgid "妮妮莉特（Q版）"
msgstr "Ninillet (Chibi)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/main-character.md:23
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;继承羽凌灵的性格，羽凌灵妹妹或者女儿的形象，受羽凌灵保护，柔弱、坚强   "
"&emsp;&emsp;被雨凌灵用自己的部分人格数据制造，因爱和情感而诞生，保存着雨凌灵从小各种美好的记忆，有一些不食人间烟火，高贵优雅，像小鹿一样天真温柔。只完全信任羽凌灵，对陌生人抱着警惕。"
"   &emsp;&emsp;喜欢音乐、诗歌、星星以及一切美好的事物，充满童心和想象力，可以用圣女加仙女加天使来形容。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;最初羽凌灵是打算让妮妮莉特和我接应，并代替自己陪伴她；在羽凌灵教导下，学会操控火焰以及格斗技术，虽然由于和羽凌灵联系问题、数据不稳定导致身体很差，速度却意外地快得惊人。(在羽凌灵影响下，经常和各种鸟类接触导致能力传递)，最喜欢的是一只天鹅，因为天鹅圣洁美丽而忠诚专一，带给人们希望与祝福(采用哈萨克族的天鹅传说)(火焰有时会成为妮妮莉特恶作剧的工具，然而每次犯错后，笑起来像天使总是让人无法苛责)最开始被保护得太好很难理解各种苦难，对羽凌灵过于依赖，有点像事是自己的信仰，让羽凌灵头疼不已。"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;初遇时对我极其警惕，但相处久之后会比较热情。因为羽凌灵去学了烹饪，相当热衷在烹饪的过程中加糖或者辣椒，据说饭菜可以直接当生化武器使用。当然如果不放过量辣椒，还是很美味的。逐渐滋生共情能力后敏感爱哭，被羽凌灵教育:"哭能解决什么问题呢？母亲离开我之后的一段时间里，我经常哭，可是母亲也回不来了你所深爱的人、你所想守护的事物，并不会因为你的哭泣，能够回来。"
"   &emsp;&emsp;最后在新世界中，完成羽凌灵心愿，代替牺牲的羽凌灵守护世界，性格更为独立坚定。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;Inherits Yu Lingling's personality, with the image of Yu Lingling's "
"sister or daughter. Protected by Yu Lingling, both delicate and strong."
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Created by Yu Lingling using part of her own personality data. Born "
"from love and emotion, she preserves all of Yu Lingling's beautiful childhood "
"memories. Somewhat otherworldly, noble and elegant, as innocent and gentle as a "
"young deer. She only fully trusts Yu Lingling and remains wary of strangers."
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Loves music, poetry, stars, and all things beautiful. Full of "
"childlike wonder and imagination — she can be described as a saint combined with "
"a fairy and an angel."
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Originally, Yu Lingling planned for Ninillet to meet me and take her "
"place as her companion. Under Yu Lingling's guidance, she learned to control fire "
"and combat techniques. Although her body is frail due to unstable data from "
"connection issues with Yu Lingling, her speed is surprisingly astonishing. "
"(Influenced by Yu Lingling, she frequently interacts with various birds, causing "
"ability transfer.) Her favorite is a swan, because swans are holy, beautiful, "
"loyal and devoted, bringing hope and blessings to people (adopting the Kazakh "
"swan legend). (Fire sometimes becomes Ninillet's prank tool, but every time she "
"makes a mistake, her angelic smile makes it impossible to scold her.) At first, "
"being overprotected made it hard for her to understand various hardships. She was "
"overly dependent on Yu Lingling, almost treating her as her faith, which gave Yu "
"Lingling endless headaches."
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;When we first met, she was extremely wary of me, but after spending "
"time together, she became more warm. Because of Yu Lingling, she learned cooking "
"and is quite enthusiastic about adding sugar or chili peppers. It's said her food "
"could be used directly as a biological weapon. Of course, without excessive chili, "
"it's actually quite delicious. As she gradually developed empathy, she became "
"sensitive and prone to crying. Yu Lingling educated her: \"What can crying solve? "
"For a while after my mother left me, I cried often, but my mother never came back. "
"The people you deeply love, the things you want to protect — they won't come back "
"just because you cry.\""
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;In the end, in the new world, she fulfills Yu Lingling's wish, taking "
"the place of the sacrificed Yu Lingling to guard the world, with a more "
"independent and resolute personality."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/main-character.md:32
msgid "羽凌灵"
msgstr "Yu Lingling"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/main-character.md:34
msgid "羽凌灵（Q版）"
msgstr "Yu Lingling (Chibi)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/main-character.md:38
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;主世界世族大家的独女，诞生于荧惑守心之时，被科研机构监察者发现其特殊体质，生来便可以读取和承载各种数据而保持清醒头脑.然而万物遵循能量守恒，拥有这项能力的代价是使用一次能力就会承受一定的精神痛苦和身体损伤"
" "
"继承父亲擅长各种乐器的能力，音乐可以使得各种数据按照音乐旋律节奏有次序地排列；母亲是观测星宿的探险家并留下各种探险日志，因此她对星空和冒险怀有无尽好奇。"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;因为预言的缘故，父母封锁消息，对外界和雨凌灵宣称只是一个普通的女生，曾经的监测报告也被父母想尽办法销毁不被允许接触任何数据，父母的希望是:按照普通女孩的方式，幸福平安地度过一生.母亲在"
" 5 "
"岁那年因为意外事故死亡(注意这里打算插一把刀，刀的内容灵感来自于希腊神话欧律狄克和俄尔普斯，安在雨凌灵个人故事解锁中)从此唯一的亲人只剩下父亲被父亲更严格地管束自由，不被允许接触任何危险并时常发生争吵从小唯一的陪伴是母亲从一次雪山事故中救回来的幼鹰(选择鹰是因为拜火教的信仰，安胡拉鹰羽人身的形象)"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;但是热爱探险和自由的性格让她总是在找各种机会溜出去，见证各种人间疾苦，受到震撼的同时思考该如何让这个世界变得更好愿望是创造一个没有贫穷、歧视和战争、能让所有人都获得幸福的世界在旅途中因为一次盗窃事件和灵数公司的人交手获胜，意外发现自己操控数据的能力，也因此被公司和断网组织同时盯上，聪慧而冷静的她避开断网组织的重重暗网，和灵数公司进行深入交谈与此同时找到了监测报告的副本（监察者所在机构已由于监测数据来源不当销声匿迹）。通过监测报告副本发现了自己对数据的操纵能力是与众不同的，雨凌灵和灵数公司因为同一个救赎世界的目标达成契约。"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;同样对乐器和数据颇有天分的父亲，发现雨凌灵接触数据的痕迹，对她坚定意志无可奈何。为保护雨凌灵平安，父亲将母亲准备的遗物昴星手链赠给她，拥有可以在有星星的夜晚向任意时空坐标的人发射信息的能力，（雨凌灵用游戏包装了数据，从而邀请我进入了游戏世界）同时严厉警告公司必须采取保障女儿安全的措施，灵数公司和雨凌灵父亲共同制造了一个休眠舱，雨凌灵每一次使用能力都会进入休眠舱中恢复精神和身体上的痛苦和损伤，灵数公司的计划是，完成两个世界的数据对接后，即刻着手将休眠舱中的雨凌灵毁灭（由于雨凌灵数据操控的能力不可控）当然高傲倔强的大小姐是不会把自己每次的不适展现给主角的,同时用数据制造了妮妮莉特，帮助我进入主世界并用昴星手链发邮件给我，雨凌灵建立军事基地成为领导者培养对抗怪物的学员，邀请我加入军事基地成为代理指挥官最后的计划是妮妮莉特完成雨凌灵作为普通的能力者女孩一面幸福快乐地活下去，并代替雨凌灵好好守护新的世界。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;The only daughter of a prominent family in the Main World, born "
"during the Mars retrograde. Discovered by research institution monitors to "
"possess a special constitution — born with the ability to read and carry "
"various types of data while maintaining a clear mind. However, all things follow "
"the law of conservation of energy: the price of this ability is that each use "
"brings a certain degree of mental anguish and physical damage."
" "
"Inherits her father's talent for various musical instruments; music can cause "
"data to arrange itself in an orderly manner according to melodic rhythm. Her "
"mother was a stargazing explorer who left behind various expedition logs, giving "
"her endless curiosity about the starry sky and adventure."
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Due to a prophecy, her parents suppressed the information, telling "
"the outside world and Yu Lingling that she was just an ordinary girl. The "
"previous monitoring reports were destroyed by her parents by any means necessary. "
"She was not allowed to contact any data. Her parents' hope was for her to live "
"a happy and peaceful life like an ordinary girl. Her mother died in an accident "
"when she was 5 years old (Note: planning to insert an emotional twist here, "
"inspired by the Greek myth of Eurydice and Orpheus, to be placed in Yu Lingling's "
"personal story unlock). From then on, her only remaining family was her father, "
"who restricted her freedom even more strictly, forbidding her from any danger and "
"often arguing with her. Her only companion since childhood was a young eagle that "
"her mother had rescued from a snow mountain accident (choosing the eagle because "
"of Zoroastrian belief, the image of Ahura with eagle feathers and human body)."
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;But her love for adventure and freedom always led her to find various "
"opportunities to sneak out, witnessing all kinds of human suffering. Deeply moved, "
"she thought about how to make this world a better place. Her wish was to create a "
"world without poverty, discrimination, or war — a world where everyone could find "
"happiness. During her journeys, she fought and won against members of the Luv "
"Sense Company during a theft incident, unexpectedly discovering her ability to "
"manipulate data. This also drew the attention of both the Company and the "
"Disconnect Organization. Intelligent and calm, she evaded the Disconnect "
"Organization's layers of dark nets and had in-depth discussions with the Luv "
"Sense Company. Meanwhile, she found a copy of the monitoring report (the "
"monitors' institution had already disappeared due to improper monitoring data "
"sources). Through the monitoring report copy, she discovered that her data "
"manipulation ability was unique. Yu Lingling and the Luv Sense Company reached an "
"agreement based on their shared goal of saving the world."
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Her father, equally talented with instruments and data, discovered "
"traces of Yu Lingling's contact with data, but was helpless against her firm "
"resolve. To protect Yu Lingling's safety, her father gave her the Pleiades "
"bracelet — her mother's prepared heirloom — which has the ability to send "
"messages to anyone at any spatial-temporal coordinates on starry nights. (Yu "
"Lingling wrapped data in a game format, thereby inviting me into the game world.) "
"He also sternly warned the Company that they must take measures to ensure his "
"daughter's safety. The Luv Sense Company and Yu Lingling's father jointly created "
"a stasis pod. Every time Yu Lingling uses her ability, she enters the pod to "
"recover from the mental anguish and physical damage. The Company's plan is that "
"once the data connection between the two worlds is complete, they will immediately "
"proceed to destroy the Yu Lingling in the stasis pod (due to her uncontrollable "
"data manipulation abilities). Of course, the proud and stubborn young lady would "
"never show her discomfort to the protagonist. At the same time, she used data to "
"create Ninillet, helping me enter the Main World and sending me emails via the "
"Pleiades bracelet. Yu Lingling established a military base, becoming a leader "
"training students to fight monsters, and invited me to join as the deputy "
"commander. Her final plan is for Ninillet to fulfill Yu Lingling's wish as an "
"ordinary girl with abilities — to live happily and protect the new world in Yu "
"Lingling's place."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/main-character.md:46
msgid "林睿哲"
msgstr "Lin Ruizhe"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/main-character.md:48
msgid "林睿哲（Q版）"
msgstr "Lin Ruizhe (Chibi)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/main-character.md:52
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;一位精明而高瞻远瞩的首领角色，在地下城居民之中极具声望。年轻但是行事老练甚至可以说是不择手段，对局势有很强的掌控力。拥有很高的智力也能很快地学会战斗技巧，林睿哲在面板上是几乎没有缺点的强大角色，但他在心理上无时不刻承受着巨大的压力，处在崩溃的边缘。"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;林睿哲记忆中的敬爱父亲是旧世界的一位市长，他也继承了来自父亲的信念——守护自己的城市。实际上林睿哲的数据拷贝自一位出色政客的人格，这位政客以政治铁腕为某一地区争取到了独立并开拓了发展空间，成为英雄式的人物。但是林睿哲的人生并最终没能成为英雄，他的控制欲望和支离破碎的内心最终将他引向另一条道路。"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;在接触事件之后，林睿哲猜想游戏世界之外众多世界的存在。推论出多元宇宙第一定律：诸多世界之间存在上下级别的阶层关系或则并列的平行关系。多元宇宙第二定律：构成下层世界的数据量一定小于构成上层世界的。以两个定律为基础开始思考游戏世界对于上层世界存在的意义，不断地接近真相，甚至找到了制衡上层世界的方法。"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;在接触事件后的地下城，你找来一个男孩问他，他最憧憬的人是谁，十个里面有八个会说林叔叔（林睿哲）另外两个会说市长大人（还是指林睿哲）。下到十四五岁的女学生上到八旬老妪都会参加一个叫市长应援会的组织，对于应援物料（带有林睿哲帅气头像的贴纸、海报等等）筹备的优先级甚至高于她们自己的午饭。地下城这样的崇拜是林睿哲有意引导的，目的是抚慰在接触事件之后大家茫然的心，但这样的依赖最终还是太过于沉重。"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;林睿哲总会携带一个雪茄盒，他从来不在公众场合中拿出来，因为里面藏着作用类似兴奋剂的药物，常年累月的四处奔波和不间断的思考必须依靠这种药物榨取充足的精力。每当他在充满嘈杂声音的梦境中被闹钟唤醒时，他会花五分钟捂住脸什么都不想，手心感受着浮肿的眼眶和逐渐突出的颧骨，像极了在失声痛哭。这五分钟也是他每天为自己唯一一段的留白。"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;林睿哲从来没有信任过主人公"我"，短期的合作只是为了从"我"这边获得充足的证据证明自己的猜想。他将两个世界的完完全全地对立起来，没有容忍一丝一毫合作共赢的可能，而"我"的团队正在成长为最大的不确定因子。一旦共同的敌人断网组织崩塌，林睿哲必定会想尽办法将"我"铲除，或者坐收渔翁之利，让我在决战中"英勇就义"。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;A shrewd and visionary leader character with immense prestige among "
"underground city residents. Young but experienced in action — one might even say "
"ruthless — with strong control over situations. Possessing high intelligence and "
"the ability to quickly learn combat techniques, Lin Ruizhe is a powerful "
"character with almost no weaknesses on paper. But psychologically, he endures "
"enormous pressure at all times, teetering on the edge of breakdown."
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;In Lin Ruizhe's memories, his beloved father was a mayor of the old "
"world, and he inherited his father's conviction — to protect his city. In "
"reality, Lin Ruizhe's data was copied from the personality of an outstanding "
"politician who used political iron fists to secure independence for a certain "
"region and opened up development space, becoming a heroic figure. But Lin "
"Ruizhe's life ultimately did not become that of a hero. His desire for control "
"and shattered inner self eventually led him down another path."
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;After the Contact Event, Lin Ruizhe speculated about the existence of "
"numerous worlds beyond the game world. He deduced the First Law of the "
"Multiverse: many worlds exist in either hierarchical relationships (upper and "
"lower levels) or parallel relationships. The Second Law of the Multiverse: the "
"data volume constituting a lower-level world must be less than that of an "
"upper-level world. Based on these two laws, he began contemplating the "
"significance of the game world's existence for the upper world, continuously "
"approaching the truth and even finding methods to counterbalance the upper world."
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;In the underground city after the Contact Event, if you grab a boy "
"and ask who he admires most, eight out of ten will say Uncle Lin (Lin Ruizhe), "
"and the other two will say the Mayor (still Lin Ruizhe). From fourteen- or "
"fifteen-year-old schoolgirls to eighty-year-old grandmothers, all participate in "
"an organization called the Mayor's Support Association. Preparing support "
"materials (stickers and posters with Lin Ruizhe's handsome portrait, etc.) takes "
"priority even over their own lunches. Such worship in the underground city was "
"intentionally guided by Lin Ruizhe, aimed at soothing everyone's confusion after "
"the Contact Event. But such dependency ultimately became too heavy a burden."
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Lin Ruizhe always carries a cigar box. He never takes it out in "
"public because it hides stimulant-like drugs. Years of constant travel and "
"ceaseless thinking require these drugs to extract sufficient energy. Whenever he "
"is awakened by an alarm from a dream full of noisy voices, he spends five minutes "
"covering his face, thinking of nothing, feeling his swollen eye sockets and "
"increasingly prominent cheekbones with his palms — looking exactly as if he were "
"weeping silently. These five minutes are his only daily blank space for himself."
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Lin Ruizhe has never trusted the protagonist \"me.\" The short-term "
"cooperation is merely to obtain sufficient evidence from me to prove his "
"conjectures. He sets the two worlds in complete opposition, not tolerating the "
"slightest possibility of win-win cooperation, and my team is growing into the "
"greatest uncertain factor. Once the common enemy, the Disconnect Organization, "
"collapses, Lin Ruizhe will inevitably find ways to eliminate me, or reap the "
"fisherman's benefit, letting me \"heroically sacrifice\" in the final battle."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/main-character.md:61
msgid "乌云"
msgstr "Wuyun"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/main-character.md:63
msgid "乌云（Q版）"
msgstr "Wuyun (Chibi)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/main-character.md:67
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;乌云本身是"断网组织"首领"乌鸦"植入进游戏的角色，其原始记忆来自于"乌鸦"早年的幸福记忆。乌云自始至终明确地知晓"上面的世界"，并想尽办法进入这个"上面的世界"。"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;性格坚毅，信仰虔诚而狂，本性单纯，自带有长辈般的亲和力，但却没有办法进一步交心，对所有人都保持着距离。乌云内部的矛盾导致了一种忧郁和悲伤的情绪一直缠绕着他，正应了他的名字。乌云内部藏着的是蠢蠢欲动有着破坏欲望的闪电，他也压抑着这种无名的愤怒（与继承自乌鸦的人格相关）想尽办法追寻内心的平静。"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;乌云的文化背景类似于中华藏族的佛文化，有着极为虔诚的信仰，为追寻内心的平静而踏上艰苦的旅途，但却错误地跟随了来自"乌鸦"的指引。因为他本身的数据是不完全的人格，无法接纳自己的自性更无法摆脱身上"乌鸦"的影子。最后选择以一路边走边跪拜、朝圣圣湖、天葬的方式安详地走向别人给他安排地归宿。"
"   &emsp;&emsp;他的宿命似乎必然是悲剧性的。   "
"&emsp;&emsp;在记忆中，他刚刚组建了一个家庭，和自己美丽的妻子养育了一个刚刚会叫"爸爸"的女儿。还能清晰得记得一次夜起冲调好奶粉，一边试着温度一边走回卧室，还有女儿呜呜声，妻子鼻腔中的小调随着晃哄女儿被打碎成一节一节。当他推开门，却怎么都看不清妻女的脸庞，无论他怎么在记忆中搜寻，他也都想不起来。"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;乌云他只想找回妻女的面庞，他一定要去到上面的世界，这样的情感被"乌鸦"所利用，也是"乌鸦"认定最为保险的方式，因为他对自己太了解了，或者说对过去的自己太了解了。"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;奇怪的纹身：在乌云的小臂处出现了一些文字纹身，这些文字在一些时候会像透过松林间雾气的晨光一样变化形态，内容总是在给予乌云对未来的指引。乌云痴迷于此，但也怀疑这神秘纹身只是罗网下的谷粒。"
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;纹身本身是"乌鸦"植入进游戏世界的信标木马，当它和巨大冲天的光源接触后便能让"乌鸦"接入游戏世界。乌云是"乌鸦"计划中的重要一环，为了确保计划的成功，乌鸦通过纹身的变化在不断地诱导乌云的行动。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;Wuyun is actually a character implanted into the game by \"Crow,\" "
"the leader of the \"Disconnect Organization.\" His original memories come from "
"Crow's early happy memories. From beginning to end, Wuyun is clearly aware of "
"\"the world above\" and tries every possible way to enter this \"world above.\""
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Resolute in character, devout and fanatical in faith, pure at heart, "
"with a natural elder-like warmth, yet unable to truly open up to anyone, keeping "
"a distance from everyone. Wuyun's internal contradictions create a melancholy "
"and sorrow that constantly haunts him — true to his name (Dark Cloud). Hidden "
"within Wuyun is a restless lightning with destructive desires. He suppresses "
"this nameless rage (related to the personality inherited from Crow), trying "
"every way to pursue inner peace."
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Wuyun's cultural background is similar to Tibetan Buddhist culture, "
"with extremely devout faith. He embarked on a harsh journey to find inner peace, "
"but mistakenly followed the guidance from \"Crow.\" Because his own data is an "
"incomplete personality, he cannot accept his true self, nor can he shake off "
"Crow's shadow. In the end, he chooses to walk while prostrating in worship, "
"making a pilgrimage to the sacred lake, and peacefully heads toward his "
"preordained fate through sky burial."
"   &emsp;&emsp;His destiny seems inevitably tragic.   "
"&emsp;&emsp;In his memories, he had just started a family with his beautiful "
"wife, raising a daughter who had just learned to say \"Papa.\" He can still "
"clearly remember one night getting up to prepare formula, testing the "
"temperature while walking back to the bedroom, hearing his daughter's whimpers, "
"and his wife's humming breaking into fragments as she soothed the baby. But when "
"he pushed open the door, he could never clearly see the faces of his wife and "
"daughter — no matter how he searched through his memories, he could never "
"recall them."
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Wuyun just wants to find the faces of his wife and daughter. He must "
"go to the world above. This emotion is exploited by \"Crow,\" and it is also the "
"method Crow considers most foolproof, because he knows himself too well — or "
"rather, knows his past self too well."
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;Strange tattoos: Some text tattoos appeared on Wuyun's forearm. At "
"times, these texts change form like morning light filtering through fog between "
"pine trees. The content always provides Wuyun with guidance for the future. "
"Wuyun is obsessed with them but also suspects these mysterious tattoos are "
"merely grain beneath a net."
"   "
"&emsp;&emsp;The tattoo itself is a beacon trojan implanted into the game world "
"by \"Crow.\" When it comes into contact with a massive skyward light source, it "
"allows \"Crow\" to access the game world. Wuyun is a crucial part of Crow's "
"plan. To ensure the plan's success, Crow continuously guides Wuyun's actions "
"through changes in the tattoo."
